    "field_desc_zh": "懒加载和虚拟滚动。为保证组件收益最大化，当数据量小于阈值 `scroll.threshold` 时，无论虚拟滚动的配置是否存在，组件内部都不会开启虚拟滚动，`scroll.threshold` 默认为 `100`",
    "field_desc_en": "Lazy loading and virtual scrolling. To maximize the benefits of the component, when the amount of data is less than the threshold `scroll.threshold`, regardless of whether the virtual scrolling configuration exists, virtual scrolling will not be enabled within the component. `scroll.threshold` defaults to `100`",
